n":"He said, \"If my fate arrives, I will die"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1271:b004:l031","ordinal":173229,"en":"And become support"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1271:b004:l032","ordinal":173230,"en":"For my renowned lone uncle.\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1271:b004:l033","ordinal":173231,"en":"He readied himself like a goshawk"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1271:b004:l034","ordinal":173232,"en":"And strained like a leopard;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1271:b004:l035","ordinal":173233,"en":"Counsel came from the unseen."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1271:b004:l036","ordinal":173234,"en":"A man became a marvel;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1271:b004:l037","ordinal":173235,"en":"Able youth and tulpar horse"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1271:b004:l038","ordinal":173236,"en":"Had reached the time to prove useful."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1271:b004:l039","ordinal":173237,"en":"Raising the bay-piebald banner,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l001","ordinal":173238,"en":"Kanchoro rode out,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l002","ordinal":173239,"en":"Calling the clamor of Khan Manas."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l003","ordinal":173240,"en":"His broad red radiant face"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l004","ordinal":173241,"en":"Was hidden rather than shown."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l005","ordinal":173242,"en":"His courage was no ordinary thing;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l006","ordinal":173243,"en":"In bearing and appearance,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l007","ordinal":173244,"en":"He was no less than hero Chubak."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l008","ordinal":173245,"en":"There was the lion named Kanchoro,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l009","ordinal":173246,"en":"Who conceived crooked schemes"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l010","ordinal":173247,"en":"And had a dark-hearted nature."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l011","ordinal":173248,"en":"Were it not for his treachery,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l012","ordinal":173249,"en":"His fortunes too were complete."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l013","ordinal":173250,"en":"As was their custom, for six months"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l014","ordinal":173251,"en":"Semetey had raised and protected him"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l015","ordinal":173252,"en":"As his own wing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l016","ordinal":173253,"en":"He had fed him the fat of the rump"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l017","ordinal":173254,"en":"And caused the sacred gray-maned hero"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l018","ordinal":173255,"en":"To call him Chubak's son."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l019","ordinal":173256,"en":"Kanykey had given her breast"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l020","ordinal":173257,"en":"To Kulchoro and Kanchoro,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l021","ordinal":173258,"en":"And nursed both of them."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l022","ordinal":173259,"en":"When Kanchoro sucked the breast,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l023","ordinal":173260,"en":"His voice reached God;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l024","ordinal":173261,"en":"Kanykey lost her strength,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l025","ordinal":173262,"en":"And from her breast then"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l026","ordinal":173263,"en":"Dark crimson blood flowed."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l027","ordinal":173264,"en":"\"In the end this one will be an enemy;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l028","ordinal":173265,"en":"Kill him outright,\" she said."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l029","ordinal":173266,"en":"Poor Kanykey wept."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l030","ordinal":173267,"en":"\"The lone boy Kanchoro—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l031","ordinal":173268,"en":"What could he possibly do?\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l032","ordinal":173269,"en":"Young Semetey would not consent."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l033","ordinal":173270,"en":"He was a dark-hearted lion;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l034","ordinal":173271,"en":"Otherwise Kanchoro"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l035","ordinal":173272,"en":"Was a lion who knew the enemy's devices."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l036","ordinal":173273,"en":"He too prepared against the Jediger,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l037","ordinal":173274,"en":"Praying to the Creator."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l038","ordinal":173275,"en":"What he chose and mounted from Talas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b003:l039","ordinal":173276,"en":"Was Kobosh Khan's tulpar."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l001","ordinal":173277,"en":"The kasaba standard floated in his hand;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l002","ordinal":173278,"en":"A golden-cheeked battle-axe"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l003","ordinal":173279,"en":"Flashed upon his arm."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l004","ordinal":173280,"en":"The sight made hearts waver;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l005","ordinal":173281,"en":"Kanchoro of Khan Chubak"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l006","ordinal":173282,"en":"Looked like his father."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l007","ordinal":173283,"en":"Against the teeming Jediger,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l008","ordinal":173284,"en":"To charge and thrust a spear,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l009","ordinal":173285,"en":"To take his ancient revenge,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l010","ordinal":173286,"en":"To unleash a great tumult,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l011","ordinal":173287,"en":"To die if death came,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l012","ordinal":173288,"en":"Or, if he survived, to break"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l013","ordinal":173289,"en":"The Jediger into fragments."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l014","ordinal":173290,"en":"If death came, he would fall to a bullet"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l015","ordinal":173291,"en":"And die at the Jediger's hands."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l016","ordinal":173292,"en":"Kanchoro rode out surging,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l017","ordinal":173293,"en":"Taking a white sacred banner"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l018","ordinal":173294,"en":"And a clamorous battle cry."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l019","ordinal":173295,"en":"He emerged from the gate"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l020","ordinal":173296,"en":"And came apart from Afghanistan."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l021","ordinal":173297,"en":"Black-bearded hero Tolok"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l022","ordinal":173298,"en":"Set his course toward hero Tolok's army;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l023","ordinal":173299,"en":"Kanchoro rode out panting."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l024","ordinal":173300,"en":"Baytaylak, son of Bakay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l025","ordinal":173301,"en":"Kalyk of Sary Khan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l026","ordinal":173302,"en":"All rode together to war."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l027","ordinal":173303,"en":"Agybay, son of Agy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l028","ordinal":173304,"en":"Brought a great army from Afghanistan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l029","ordinal":173305,"en":"Bringing troops in abundance."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l030","ordinal":173306,"en":"As they prepared and gathered the people,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l031","ordinal":173307,"en":"His white turban was cauldron-sized,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l032","ordinal":173308,"en":"And when he shouted, his voice was like the call to prayer:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l033","ordinal":173309,"en":"Akun Khan's son stood apart."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l034","ordinal":173310,"en":"The command drum was beaten;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l035","ordinal":173311,"en":"Akun's people closed in,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1272:b004:l036","ordinal":173312,"en":"Dividing into many kinds."}]
